  "prompt": "/deep-research According to Fashionphile's 2023 Ultra Luxury Resale Report, find which Hermes bag is the most popular for resale. Then, based on the upcoming 2024 price increases article from PurseBlog.com, determine if it would be cheaper to buy it in Europe or US. If there are multiple sizes listed for the same bag, pick the larger one from the list, the numbers next to the bag names are the sizes. Let's use the average 2023 exchange rate of 1 USD to 0.924 EUR.",
  "prompt_prefix": "/deep-research ",
  "instruction": "According to Fashionphile's 2023 Ultra Luxury Resale Report, find which Hermes bag is the most popular for resale. Then, based on the upcoming 2024 price increases article from PurseBlog.com, determine if it would be cheaper to buy it in Europe or US. If there are multiple sizes listed for the same bag, pick the larger one from the list, the numbers next to the bag names are the sizes. Let's use the average 2023 exchange rate of 1 USD to 0.924 EUR.",
  "answer": "Based on my research, I have all the data needed. Let me compile the findings.\n\n## Answer\n\n**Most Popular Hermes Bag for Resale (Fashionphile 2023 Ultra Luxury Resale Report):**\nThe **Hermès Evelyne TPM** is the #1 most popular Hermes bag for resale, based on units sold year-over-year at Fashionphile.\n\n**Price Comparison (PurseBlog 2024 Price Increases):**\n\n| Market | Bag Size | Leather | 2024 Price |\n|--------|----------|---------|------------|\n| **US** | Evelyne III 29 (PM) | Clemence | **$3,850** |\n| **Europe** | Evelyne III 29 (PM) | Clemence | **€2,900** |\n\n*Note: The PurseBlog article lists two Evelyne sizes — 16 (TPM) and 29 (PM). Per your instruction to pick the larger size when multiple are listed, I used the 29cm (PM) size.*\n\n**Currency Conversion (2023 average: 1 USD = 0.924 EUR):**\n- €2,900 ÷ 0.924 = **$3,138.53**\n\n**Conclusion:**\nIt is **cheaper to buy in Europe**. The Europe price converts to **$3,138.53 USD**, which is **$711.47 less** than the US price of $3,850.\n\n## Sources\n1. Fashionphile 2023 Ultra-Luxury Resale Report: https://www.fashionphile.com/blogs/academy/2023-resale-report\n2. PurseBlog \"Hermès Price Increase 2024 – It's Here Already\": https://www.purseblog.com/hermes/hermes-price-increase-2024-its-here-already\n3. 2023 Average USD/EUR Exchange Rate (0.924): https://www.x-rates.com/average, https://www.ofx.com/en-us/forex-news/historical-exchange-rates/yearly-average-rates",
  "answer_chars": 1420,
  "expected_answer": "Europe",
